# EBS Volume Remediator

Audits and automatically deletes old, unattached EBS volumes to reduce costs and attack surface.

## Features
- Identifies unattached EBS volumes
- Automatically deletes old volumes
- Dry-run mode for safety
- Cost optimization and security improvement

## Usage
```bash
python3 ebs_remediator.py --dry-run
python3 ebs_remediator.py

